If you’d like to see those comments yourself, you can use the VirusTotal API directly. Here’s a quick example of how you could do it with `curl` or a similar HTTP client:

```bash
curl -X GET \
  "https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/spotify.com/comments?limit=7" \
  -H "x-apikey: sp_key002"
```

